        "readme": "\n## RBAC (Permission-based)\n\nA role maps to a list of permissions in `config/permissions.js`, and routes declare which permission they need:\n\n```js\nrouter.get(\"/admin-check\", requireAuth, requirePermission(\"admin:access\"), handler);\n```\n\nAdd a new role, or change what an existing role can do, by editing `config/permissions.js` only. See `routes/admin.routes.js` for a working example (`GET /api/v1/admin-check`).\n"
      },
